Code derived from XFOIL
-----------------------

xfoil_closures.py, shipped twice with identical bodies
(src/vortfoil/_staged/common/xfoil_closures.py and
code/model/staged/common/xfoil_closures.py), is a line-by-line Python/TensorFlow
translation of boundary-layer closure routines of XFOIL 6.99: HKIN, HSL, HST,
CFL, CFT, DIL, DILW and DAMPL and terms of BLVAR, BLDIF and TRDIF from
src/xblsys.f, and the BLPINI constants from src/xbl.f.

    XFOIL 6.99
    Copyright (C) 2000 Mark Drela, Harold Youngren
    (the headers of xblsys.f and xbl.f read "Copyright (C) 2000 Mark Drela")
    https://web.mit.edu/drela/Public/web/xfoil/

XFOIL is free software distributed under the GNU General Public License,
"either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version" (the
headers of xblsys.f and xbl.f in the xfoil6.99.tgz distribution). The
translation is a modified version of that work. This release distributes it,
together with the rest of the package, under version 3 of the GPL or any later
version, which XFOIL's "or later" clause permits. Version 3 rather than
version 2 because the package depends on TensorFlow, whose Apache License 2.0
the Free Software Foundation lists as compatible with GPL version 3 but not
with version 2.

XFOIL's authors have not reviewed or endorsed the translation. XFOIL itself is
not included, and no XFOIL process is run at inference time; scripts that
regenerate training labels call an XFOIL binary the user supplies (XFOIL_EXE).


Data
----

The training and evaluation data keep their own licenses; details and
attributions are in DATA_LICENSES.md.

  - AirfRANS (Bonnet et al., 2022), Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0:
    weights/airfrans_surface_tokens.npz is an extract of it, and the field
    figures and field decoders are produced from it.
  - UIUC Airfoil Coordinates Database (M. S. Selig, UIUC Applied Aerodynamics
    Group): the evaluation shapes in data/eval/ are fits of its sections.

DATA_LICENSES.md also carries the attribution for dataset-derived files that
remain reachable in this repository's earlier commits.
